{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 3873464,
  "courseSlug": "nextjs-react-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Next.js & React - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25146622",
      "title": "Working with \"Event Props\"",
      "lectureOrder": 64,
      "videoOrder": 60,
      "sourceHash": "2e8edcaa7a433d706dc4af9375023c98185cda814cc49bb3afe95ae7cb7d33f7",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.15,
          "end": 4.8,
          "en": "To get rid of the modal and the Backdrop now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.8,
          "end": 6.93,
          "en": "we need to change the state again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.93,
          "end": 10.02,
          "en": "from setModalIsOpen true to false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.02,
          "end": 12.16,
          "en": "We need to call setModalIsOpen again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.16,
          "end": 14.023,
          "en": "and pass false as a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.01,
          "end": 19.1,
          "en": "The problem just is when do we wanna do that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.1,
          "end": 21.83,
          "en": "We wanna do that when the Backdrop is clicked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.83,
          "end": 24.91,
          "en": "or when the Cancel or Confirm buttons are clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.91,
          "end": 26.02,
          "en": "We don't wanna do that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.02,
          "end": 28.573,
          "en": "if the modal itself is clicked for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.92,
          "end": 31.52,
          "en": "Now for the Backdrop click,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.52,
          "end": 33.46,
          "en": "you could think that on Backdrop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.46,
          "end": 36.04,
          "en": "you simply add onClick again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.04,
          "end": 38.71,
          "en": "and then we add a second function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.71,
          "end": 43.14,
          "en": "the closeModalHandler, let's say",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.03,
          "end": 48.15,
          "en": "and there we call setModalIsOpen and set this to false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.15,
          "end": 52.11,
          "en": "And then we point at this closeModalHandler here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.11,
          "end": 54.2,
          "en": "as a value for onClick,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.2,
          "end": 56.483,
          "en": "just as we did it with the button in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.7,
          "end": 59.14,
          "en": "But that won't work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.14,
          "end": 60.5,
          "en": "If we save that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.63,
          "end": 62.94,
          "en": "and I reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 62.94,
          "end": 64.9,
          "en": "I can click the Backdrop the entire day",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 64.9,
          "end": 66.453,
          "en": "the modal won't close.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 67.34,
          "end": 68.84,
          "en": "The reason for this is that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 68.84,
          "end": 72.95,
          "en": "the Backdrop like the modal is our own component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 72.95,
          "end": 76.14,
          "en": "These are not built-in components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 76.14,
          "end": 78.63,
          "en": "So they don't know the onClick prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 78.63,
          "end": 83.56,
          "en": "Our own components have to be configured 100% by us.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 83.56,
          "end": 87.45,
          "en": "They have no built-in props which we can use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 87.45,
          "end": 89.25,
          "en": "To be precise, they actually do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.25,
          "end": 91.92,
          "en": "but only for some very special cases",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 91.92,
          "end": 95.35,
          "en": "and not for event listeners like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 95.35,
          "end": 98.91,
          "en": "So if you wanna make sure that our onClick prop exists",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.91,
          "end": 102.14,
          "en": "in the Backdrop component, we have to add code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 102.14,
          "end": 105.78999999999999,
          "en": "to this component function to support this prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 105.78999999999999,
          "end": 108.33,
          "en": "And for this we can go to the component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 108.33,
          "end": 110.78,
          "en": "and accept this props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 110.78,
          "end": 113.46000000000001,
          "en": "Argument here does props parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 113.46000000000001,
          "end": 116.25999999999999,
          "en": "and then here, we can of course work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 116.25999999999999,
          "end": 119.87,
          "en": "with the onClick prop or any other name we want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 119.87,
          "end": 122.37,
          "en": "It's totally up to you because it's our component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 123.49,
          "end": 127.51,
          "en": "But here we can, for example, expect a onClick prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 127.51,
          "end": 130.81,
          "en": "because I'm setting this here in the to-do component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 130.81,
          "end": 134.1,
          "en": "and we actually expect a function as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 134.1,
          "end": 136.21,
          "en": "on this onClick prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 136.21,
          "end": 137.89,
          "en": "because in the to-do component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 137.89,
          "end": 140.82999999999998,
          "en": "I do pass in a function in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 140.82999999999998,
          "end": 142.64,
          "en": "I point at a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 142.64,
          "end": 145.47,
          "en": "which means I pass a point or two to function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 145.47,
          "end": 147.823,
          "en": "as a value it for this prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 149.02,
          "end": 151.2,
          "en": "Now in the Backdrop component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 151.2,
          "end": 153.64,
          "en": "we actually wanna call this function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 153.64,
          "end": 156.74,
          "en": "which we receive on the onClick prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 156.74,
          "end": 158.8,
          "en": "when this div is clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 158.8,
          "end": 161.77,
          "en": "Now the div is a built-in component again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 161.77,
          "end": 164.04,
          "en": "so it does have onClick prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 164.04,
          "end": 166,
          "en": "and now we could simply point",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 166,
          "end": 169.32,
          "en": "at props onClick as a value here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 169.32,
          "end": 171.32999999999998,
          "en": "By doing this we would in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 171.32999999999998,
          "end": 175.76,
          "en": "forward the function which we receive on our props here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 175.76,
          "end": 177.9,
          "en": "on our onClick prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 177.9,
          "end": 182.17,
          "en": "into that div on it's onClick prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 182.17,
          "end": 184.55,
          "en": "And these names don't have to be equal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 184.55,
          "end": 188,
          "en": "We could expect a onCancel prop here instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 188,
          "end": 191.903,
          "en": "and in to do component rename this to onCancel.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 192.85,
          "end": 195.873,
          "en": "It's our components so we can name this however we want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 196.82,
          "end": 199.81,
          "en": "Now if we do that and save all the files,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 199.81,
          "end": 202.67000000000002,
          "en": "if I reload, now we can close the modal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 202.67000000000002,
          "end": 204.56,
          "en": "by clicking the Backdrop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 204.56,
          "end": 207.07,
          "en": "because now we're using a prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 207.07,
          "end": 209.42000000000002,
          "en": "to pass a function as a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 209.42000000000002,
          "end": 211.85,
          "en": "And that's a pattern which can be confusing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 211.85,
          "end": 213.84,
          "en": "and might look strange at first,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 213.84,
          "end": 216.39,
          "en": "but keep in mind that in Java script",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 216.39,
          "end": 219.66,
          "en": "functions are first class objects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 219.66,
          "end": 222.55,
          "en": "You can pass them around as values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 222.55,
          "end": 224.5,
          "en": "just as you can pass strings",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 224.5,
          "end": 228.18,
          "en": "and arrays and objects and numbers as values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 228.18,
          "end": 230.94,
          "en": "Hence you can pass a function as arguments",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 230.94,
          "end": 234.54,
          "en": "to another function and therefore also as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 234.54,
          "end": 237.25,
          "en": "for a prop to a number of component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 237.25,
          "end": 240.64,
          "en": "And then that function which we receive in that component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 240.64,
          "end": 243.32,
          "en": "can be executed in that component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 243.32,
          "end": 246.54,
          "en": "or as we're doing it here, it can be forwarded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 246.54,
          "end": 250.7,
          "en": "to yet another element another component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 250.7,
          "end": 253.21,
          "en": "Now we can use that same approach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 253.21,
          "end": 257.14,
          "en": "in the modal component for canceling and confirming.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 257.14,
          "end": 262.14,
          "en": "There we could add functions like the cancelHandler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 262.41,
          "end": 265.7,
          "en": "and then let's say the confirmHandler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 265.7,
          "end": 267.56,
          "en": "and kick off different logic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 267.56,
          "end": 270.49,
          "en": "depending on which button was clicked,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 270.49,
          "end": 272.72,
          "en": "but in this case, I'll simply",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 272.72,
          "end": 275.47,
          "en": "in the end run the same code in both functions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 275.47,
          "end": 278.15999999999997,
          "en": "Nonetheless, we can bind the first button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 278.15999999999997,
          "end": 281.02,
          "en": "with the onClick prop to cancelHandler,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 281.02,
          "end": 283.3,
          "en": "and here it has to be onClick",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 283.3,
          "end": 285.79,
          "en": "because that's not a custom component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 285.79,
          "end": 287.17,
          "en": "but a built-in one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 287.17,
          "end": 290.54,
          "en": "So here we can't come up with any other name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 290.54,
          "end": 293.61,
          "en": "And for the Confirm button I'll also add onClick",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 293.61,
          "end": 295.493,
          "en": "and point at the confirmHandler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 296.62,
          "end": 298.23,
          "en": "And now in these functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 298.23,
          "end": 300.81,
          "en": "we can run any code we want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 300.81,
          "end": 302.89,
          "en": "In this case though I also wanna",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 302.89,
          "end": 304.66,
          "en": "just close the modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 304.66,
          "end": 308.31,
          "en": "So again, I'll just accept the props parameter here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 308.31,
          "end": 309.92,
          "en": "and then cancelHandler,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 309.92,
          "end": 314.15,
          "en": "I'll just execute props on Cancel let's say",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 314.15,
          "end": 315.58,
          "en": "in the confirmHandler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 315.58,
          "end": 318.633,
          "en": "I'll execute props on Confirm.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 319.53,
          "end": 322.34,
          "en": "And hence instead of defining these functions here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 322.34,
          "end": 323.82,
          "en": "and pointing at them here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 323.82,
          "end": 327.27,
          "en": "we could have also just forwarded props onCancel here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 327.27,
          "end": 328.96,
          "en": "like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 328.96,
          "end": 331.01,
          "en": "Just as we did it for the Backdrop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 331.01,
          "end": 333.29,
          "en": "I'm just showing this alternative approach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 333.29,
          "end": 335.04,
          "en": "to make it crystal clear",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 335.04,
          "end": 337.21,
          "en": "that you can execute these functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 337.21,
          "end": 339.23,
          "en": "which you receive through props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 339.23,
          "end": 341.64,
          "en": "You can forward them to other elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 341.64,
          "end": 343.28,
          "en": "if that's what you need to do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 343.28,
          "end": 346.99,
          "en": "but you can also execute them anywhere in your components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 346.99,
          "end": 349.65,
          "en": "And hence, I'm using this alternative setup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 349.65,
          "end": 352.3,
          "en": "with these extra wrapper functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 352.3,
          "end": 353.883,
          "en": "at which I then point here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 355.25,
          "end": 358.8,
          "en": "And now we've got our onCancel and onConfirm prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 358.8,
          "end": 361.73,
          "en": "which are expected on that modal component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 361.73,
          "end": 365.41,
          "en": "So in the place where we use the modal component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 365.41,
          "end": 369.387,
          "en": "we should add onCancel and onConfirm.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 370.88,
          "end": 372.68,
          "en": "And here in both cases",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 372.68,
          "end": 375.73,
          "en": "I'll just point at the closeModalHandler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 375.73,
          "end": 377.33,
          "en": "because as mentioned before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 377.33,
          "end": 379.5,
          "en": "here I got no special logic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 379.5,
          "end": 381.383,
          "en": "I just wanna close the modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 383.42,
